<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:<%= t['ink-950'] %>;">Reconnect Google for <%= projectName %></h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Google stopped sharing your Analytics and Search Console data with AEO Corner. This usually happens when the person who connected it changes their Google password or removes the access.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">Nothing is lost: the traffic we already stored is still there. Until you reconnect, new visits from AI answers won’t be added. It takes about a minute.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;"><a href="<%= trafficUrl %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background-color:<%= t['brand-600'] %>;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px;">Reconnect Google</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:<%= t['ink-700'] %>;">We send this once a month at most, however long it stays disconnected.</p>
